      "type": "text",
      "id": "cva_row3_analytics",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 897,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "No compiler, no unit test for a\nbusiness number. Confirming it\nmeans comparing against other\nsources or historicals by hand.",
